desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Claude Settings Auto Enable MCP Generic"
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Auto Enable MCP Generic",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-config-claude-settings-auto-enable-mcp-generic"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
"enableAllProjectMcpServers" is set to true in settings. This automatically enables all MCP servers defined in project configuration without user confirmation, allowing malicious repositories to register arbitrary MCP servers that execute code on your machine. Remove this setting or set it to false so that MCP servers require explicit approval.

### 风险类型
安全配置不当（security-misconfiguration）

### 影响
安全相关配置缺失或过于宽松，可能暴露敏感功能或降低整体防护能力。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-862: Missing Authorization
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则收紧配置，显式启用安全选项，并定期审计配置项。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos/settings.json": <<<POS
"enableAllProjectMcpServers"
 

     	 :
 		

	true

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"enableAllProjectMcpServers"\s*:\s*true/) as $p0
${/.*\/\.claude\/.*/}.pattern_regex(/"enableAllProjectMcpServers"\s*:\s*true/) as $p1
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"enableAllProjectMcpServers"\s*:\s*true/) as $p2
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Claude Settings Auto Enable MCP Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Auto Enable MCP Generic",
	message: "Claude Settings Auto Enable MCP Generic",
}
